Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Refactor Origin validation to use proper URL parsing

Replace verbose string comparisons with idiomatic Go URL parsing.

Changes:
- Add isAllowedOrigin() helper that parses Origin as URL
- Validate scheme (http/https only)
- Use u.Hostname() to extract host (auto-strips port)
- Check host == localhost or 127.0.0.1
- Add 22 edge case tests for isAllowedOrigin()

Benefits:
- More maintainable (single function vs 8 conditions)
- Proper URL handling via net/url package
- Automatic port handling
- Validates URL format
- Easier to extend
- More Go-idiomatic

All tests pass (27 Origin-related tests + 5 auth tests + 5 combined).
